    course_description = '<p>This qualification equips you, as a pastry chef, to take a supervisory or team-leading role in the kitchen. You will operate independently or with limited guidance from others and use discretion to solve non-routine problems.</p> <p>This qualification provides a pathway to work in various organisations where patisserie products are prepared and served, including patisseries, restaurants, hotels, catering operations, clubs, pubs, cafés, and coffee shops.</p>',
